Package: ezrlearning
Type: Package
Title: Learn the 'ezr' Family with a Book and Practice Exercises
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andreas", "Schellewald", email = "aschellewald@acm.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A teaching companion for the 'ezr' family of survey and modelling
    packages, built from hands-on workshop material. Generates practice and
    revision exercises -- multiple choice and "write the 'ezr' code" tasks --
    that are reproducible from a seed yet randomised across draws, grades a
    learner's answer by running real 'ezrsurvey' and 'ezrmodel' code, assembles
    quizzes and exports them as self-contained worksheets, and can draft fresh
    exercises from a language model. Each exercise links to a chapter of the
    accompanying book so reading and practice stay in step.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
